	// Payload Per-type body. For transfer_receive (A08) it carries transferId, items, discrepancyReason and approvalGrantId (from createTransferReceiveApproval); it never carries a pin, and the server ignores any approverUserId (the approver is the grant's). An item without a usable grant is refused as forbidden and goes to review. For refund (C4a) see SyncRefundPayload: legacy {orderId, reason} refunds the whole order; the per-line shape adds items [{lineNo, quantity}], refundAmount and reasonCode. For order the body is CreateOrderRequest (C6a adds tenders [TenderInput]).
